>  
> typedef struct __hw_pte_t { pte_t __pte; } hw_pte_t;
> 
> I'lll add __hw_pte_t to this series. (Initially on last email I'd thought
> that the first user would add __hw_pte_t. But it seems sensible to add it
> now)

